function printSchoolFeeReceipt(charge:any,payment:any,formalReceipt?:any){const escape=(value:any)=>String(value??"").replace(/[&<>\"']/g,ch=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;"}[ch]));const popup=window.open("","_blank","width=720,height=900");if(!popup)return;popup.document.write(`<!doctype html><html><head><title>Fee receipt</title><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding:32px;color:#111}h1{margin:0 0 6px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:18px}td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}td:first-child{color:#555;width:38%}.receipt{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:24px;max-width:680px;margin:auto}button{padding:10px 18px;margin-top:24px}@media print{button{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class="receipt"><h1>${escape(formalReceipt?.schoolSnapshot?.schoolName||"Fee Payment Receipt")}</h1><h2>Fee Payment Receipt</h2><p>Formal Receipt: ${escape(formalReceipt?.receiptNumber||"Not issued")}</p><table><tr><td>Receipt number</td><td>${escape(formalReceipt?.receiptNumber||"—")}</td></tr><tr><td>Charge</td><td>${escape(charge.chargeCode||charge.id)}</td></tr><tr><td>Fee title</td><td>${escape(charge.title)}</td></tr><tr><td>Student ID</td><td>${escape(charge.studentId)}</td></tr><tr><td>Payment reference</td><td>${escape(payment.reference)}</td></tr><tr><td>Invoice</td><td>${escape(payment.invoice?.invoiceNumber||'Charge-level payment')}</td></tr><tr><td>Installment allocation</td><td>${(formalReceipt?.allocationSnapshot||[]).map((a:any)=>escape(`Installment ${a.installmentSequence} · Due ${String(a.dueAt||"").slice(0,10)} · ${formalReceipt.currency} ${a.amount}`)).join("<br/>")||"No installment allocation"}</td></tr><tr><td>Payment date</td><td>${escape(String(payment.paidAt||"").slice(0,10))}</td></tr><tr><td>Method</td><td>${escape(payment.method)}</td></tr><tr><td>Amount received</td><td>${escape(payment.currency||charge.currency)} ${escape(payment.amount)}</td></tr><tr><td>Charge total</td><td>${escape(charge.currency)} ${escape(charge.amount)}</td></tr><tr><td>Paid to date</td><td>${escape(charge.currency)} ${escape(charge.amountPaid)}</td></tr><tr><td>Outstanding</td><td>${escape(charge.currency)} ${(Number(charge.amount)-Number(charge.amountPaid)).toFixed(2)}</td></tr></table><button onclick="window.print()">Print receipt</button></div></body></html>`);popup.document.close();popup.focus();}
